# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# HELIOS Mobile — Expo Environment Variables
# Copy this file to .env for local overrides.
# Variables must be prefixed with EXPO_PUBLIC_ to be embedded in the bundle.
# The .env file is excluded from version control.
#
# Expo docs: https://docs.expo.dev/guides/environment-variables/
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# ── API Configuration ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# API base URL. When set, this is used in every environment:
# iOS Simulator, Android emulator, physical devices, staging, and production.
#
# If this is not set in development, HELIOS falls back to:
# - iOS Simulator: http://localhost:8000
# - Android Emulator: http://10.0.2.2:8000
#
# Physical devices require this value because localhost points to the device,
# not your Mac. Use your machine's LAN IP while the backend is running locally.
#
# Local physical-device example:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=http://192.168.1.110:8000
#
# Production example:
# EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://your-api.your-domain.com
